    "title": "MANGMI AIR X Handheld Console \u2014 Snapdragon 662, Adreno 610, 4GB/64GB, 5.5\" FHD 400nits, Android 14, 5000mAh, Wi-Fi5, BT5.0, USB-C",
    "body_html": "<!-- \ud83d\udd25 MANGMI AIR X Handheld Console | Card-style Spec Sheet for Shopify -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 MANGMI <span style=\"color: #ea580c;\">AIR X</span> Handheld Console</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">Qualcomm Snapdragon 662 \u2022 Adreno 610 \u2022 5.5\" FHD IPS \u2022 Android 14 \u2022 Active Cooling</p>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (SoC)</strong><br>Qualcomm Snapdragon 662</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>CPU</strong><br>4\u00d7 Cortex-A73 @ 2.1 GHz + 4\u00d7 Cortex-A53 @ 2.0 GHz</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Adreno 610 @ 1050 MHz</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>4 GB LPDDR4X</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>64 GB eMMC<br>TF Card Expansion</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display</strong><br>5.5\" IPS, 1920 \u00d7 1080 (FHD)<br>400 nits brightness</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless Connectivity</strong><br>Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac)</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Bluetooth</strong><br>Bluetooth 5.0</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Ports</strong><br>USB Type-C<br>3.5 mm Headphone Jack<br>TF Card Slot</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Cooling System</strong><br>Single-fan Active Cooling</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>Android 14</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>5000 mAh</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging</strong><br>15 W Fast Charging</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Controls &amp; Sensors</strong><br>RGB Wide-angle Hall Joysticks<br>Hall Triggers<br>6-axis Gyroscope</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions (mm)</strong><br>203.47 \u00d7 87.39 \u00d7 16.80</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Weight</strong><br>286 g</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br>\n<span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">\ud83c\udfae Snapdragon Performance \u2022 FHD Display \u2022 Active Cooling \u2022 Android 14</span>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">\nSpecifications may vary depending on configuration and region.\n</p>\n</div>\n",
